{"articleNo":"933","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=933&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"샤워실 온수공급 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.10.08","hit":"10017","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 샤워실 온수공급 안내<br><!--StartFragment--></font></font></strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">샤워실에 전기온수기 설치가 완료됨에 따라 다음과 같이 온수를 공급할 계획이오니 이용 바랍니다.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font size=\"3\">❏온수공급일시 : 2009. 10. 12부터(하절기 제외)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font size=\"3\">❏온수공급장소 (8개소)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; O테크노관 : 1층 샤워실 (2개소)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; O디지털관 : 지하 1층, 1층 샤워실 (2개소)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; O글로벌관 : 1층 샤워실 (2개소)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; O도 서 관 : 1층 샤워실 (1개소)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;O공동실습관 : 1층 샤워실 (1개소)</font></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
